[[File:DamagedBulkCruiser-EitEDabgCiv.png|thumb|right|250px|A destroyed ''Neutron Star''-class bulk cruiser.]]
A '''bulk cruiser''' was a type of [[cruiser]] used by the [[Galactic Empire]] near the [[planet]] [[Tatooine]].<ref name="A New Hope" /> The [[Neutron Star-class bulk cruiser|''Neutron Star''-class bulk cruiser]] was one [[starship]] type under this class, as was the [[Deep Space Recovery Vessel L-2783]].<ref name="Starships and Speeders">''[[Starships and Speeders]]''</ref>

